---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="About Alex Cruz-Valencia — a product management student targeting APM internships for summer 2027.">

  <section class="about-hero content-width">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>The kind of PM who asks "why" before "what."</h1>
  </section>

  <hr />

  <div class="about-body content-width">
    <div class="bio">
      <p>
        I'm Alex Cruz-Valencia, a Computer Science major and Human-Centered Design minor
        at Dartmouth, Class of 2028. I grew up in Salinas, California, and I'm looking
        for an APM or PM internship for summer 2027.
      </p>
      <p>
        My work sits between building and understanding — I can read a schema and I can
        run a user interview, and I think both belong in the room when a product decision
        gets made. Most of my experience is in wellness and behavioral-health tools: I led
        a 6-person design team on <a href="https://evergreen.dartmouth.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Evergreen</a>,
        Dartmouth's student-built generative-AI flourishing platform, and I've been Product
        Director at <a href="https://youphoriaapp.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Youphoria</a>,
        a live social-wellness app.
      </p>
      <p>
        The through-line is a pull toward products that help people live a little better —
        and a habit of testing my own assumptions before I trust them. On Evergreen I
        recommended cutting a permissions ask by two-thirds based on student research;
        when leadership disagreed, I negotiated a commitment to A/B test it rather than
        let the question quietly disappear.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside product work, I box, play poker, sew and tailor my own clothes, and build
        custom keyboards.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-aside">
      <div class="aside-block">
        <p class="aside-label">Currently</p>
        <p>Dartmouth College, Class of 2028</p>
        <p>B.A. Computer Science, minor in Human-Centered Design</p>
      </div>
      <div class="aside-block">
        <p class="aside-label">Seeking</p>
        <p>APM / PM Internships — Summer 2027</p>
      </div>
      <div class="aside-block">
        <p class="aside-label">Interested in</p>
        <p>Behavioral-health &amp; wellness technology · Language access and education equity · Consumer products that build durable habits</p>
      </div>
      <div class="aside-block">
        <p class="aside-label">Based in</p>
        <p>Salinas, CA · Hanover, NH</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-ctas">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn">Get in touch →</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/alex-cruz-valencia" class="btn btn-outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        LinkedIn ↗
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

</Layout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding: 5.5rem 0 3.5rem;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.125rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .about-body {
    padding: 4rem 0 5rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 280px;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto;
    gap: 3rem 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .bio {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .bio p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .bio a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }

  .bio a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent-hover);
  }

  .about-aside {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    padding-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .aside-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.2rem;
  }

  .aside-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .aside-block p:not(.aside-label) {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .about-ctas {
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 2;
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.875rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }

    .about-aside {
      grid-column: 1;
      grid-row: 2;
      padding-top: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
      padding-top: 2rem;
    }

    .about-ctas {
      grid-row: 3;
    }
  }
</style>
